WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:23.804
The tailor climbed into bed.

2
00:00:23.805 --> 00:00:28.776
He shivered and moaned.

3
00:00:28.777 --> 00:00:38.767
"Buttons! I need buttons for the coat."

4
00:00:38.768 --> 00:00:41.708
Mrs. Tiggywinkle looked at the coat.

5
00:00:41.709 --> 00:00:47.138
"I will finish this coat.

6
00:00:47.139 --> 00:00:49.294
But I need help."

7
00:00:49.295 --> 00:00:53.413
Suddenly she smiled. "Of course!

8
00:00:53.414 --> 00:00:59.007
I know who can help me."

9
00:00:59.008 --> 00:01:11.942
Mrs. Tiggywinkle ran outside.

10
00:01:11.943 --> 00:01:16.765
She passed the shop. "Hmm," she said.

11
00:01:16.766 --> 00:01:18.865
"The shop is not closed today.

12
00:01:18.866 --> 00:01:23.701
It is open!"

13
00:01:23.702 --> 00:01:28.187
Mrs. Tiggywinkle hurried to the rabbits' house.

14
00:01:28.188 --> 00:01:30.496
She knocked on the door.

15
00:01:30.497 --> 00:01:36.252
"Bunnies!" she called. "I need help!"

16
00:01:36.253 --> 00:01:39.210
The three bunnies opened the door.

17
00:01:39.211 --> 00:01:43.717
"Will you help me sew a coat?" Mrs. Tiggywinkle asked.

18
00:01:43.718 --> 00:01:46.028
"It's for the mayor."

19
00:01:46.029 --> 00:01:49.262
"The mayor?" Flopsy squealed.

20
00:01:49.263 --> 00:01:52.873
"His coat?" Mopsy gasped.

21
00:01:52.874 --> 00:02:01.097
"Let's go!" Cotton-tail cried.

22
00:02:01.098 --> 00:02:06.101
The bunnies got their sewing baskets.

23
00:02:06.102 --> 00:02:21.136
They hopped to the tailor's house.

24
00:02:21.137 --> 00:02:24.969
Mrs. Tiggywinkle started to sew.

25
00:02:24.970 --> 00:02:32.801
The bunnies started to sew, and . . .

26
00:02:32.802 --> 00:02:36.966
Soon the coat was done!

27
00:02:36.967 --> 00:02:45.128
"But something is missing," Flopsy said.

28
00:02:45.129 --> 00:02:51.894
"Buttons!" Mopsy and Cotton-tail said.
